      "speaker": "kraken",
      "text": "……。",
      "cast": [
        "kraken"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C14",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 26,
      "speaker": "arachne",
      "text": "……。",
      "cast": [
        "arachne"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C15",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 27,
      "speaker": "slime",
      "text": "……。",
      "cast": [
        "slime"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C16",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 28,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "みんな？",
      "cast": [
        "kraken",
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C17",
      "accents": {
        "hinata": "question"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06,
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 29,
      "speaker": "kraken",
      "text": "……もう、帰った方がいい気がするわねえ。",
      "cast": [
        "kraken",
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C17",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 30,
      "speaker": "arachne",
      "text": "ええ。私たちは……ダンジョンにいるべきです。",
      "cast": [
        "arachne"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C18",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 31,
      "speaker": "slime",
      "text": "かえろー。",
      "cast": [
        "slime"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C19",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 32,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "ええ！？",
      "cast": [
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C20",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "hinata": "exclaim"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.6,
      "accent_delay": 0.06,
      "sfx": "res://audio/adv/lab/decision22.wav",
      "sfx_delay": 0.1
    },
    {
      "source_line": 33,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "いやいや、ここまで引っ越してきたじゃないっすか！",
      "cast": [
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C20",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "hinata": "exclaim"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 34,
      "speaker": "kraken",
      "text": "……そうだったわね。",
      "cast": [
        "kraken"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C21",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 35,
      "speaker": "arachne",
      "text": "……どうして、あんなことを口にしたのでしょう。",
      "cast": [
        "arachne"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C22",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 36,
      "speaker": "slime",
      "text": "なんで帰ろうとしたんだっけー。",
      "cast": [
        "slime"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C23",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "slime": "question"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.6,
      "accent_delay": 0.06,
      "sfx": "res://audio/adv/lab/stupid3.wav",
      "sfx_delay": 0.1
    },
    {
      "source_line": 37,
      "speaker": "flare",
      "text": "……人間だけではなかった。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C24",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 38,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "え？",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C24",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "hinata": "question"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 39,
      "speaker": "flare",
      "text": "鐘が鳴った時、魔物の皆さんにも同じような異変が起きている。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C24",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 40,
      "speaker": "arachne",
      "text": "だから今まで、誰も地上へ出ようとは……。",
      "cast": [
        "arachne"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C25",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 41,
      "speaker": "kraken",
      "text": "考える前から、“そういうもの”だったのねえ。",
      "cast": [
        "kraken"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C26",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 42,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "……だから、あたしが引っ越そうって言うまで。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C27",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 43,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "みんな、地上に住むって発想自体なかったんすね。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C27",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 44,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "……魔王様は？",
      "cast": [
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C27",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "hinata": "question"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 45,
      "speaker": "maou",
      "text": "うむ。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "maou"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C28",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 46,
      "speaker": "kraken",
      "text": "……いつも通りすぎて、効いてるのか分からないわねえ。",
      "cast": [
        "kraken"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C29",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "kraken": "sweat"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.6,
      "accent_delay": 0.06,
      "sfx": "res://audio/adv/lab/stupid3.wav",
      "sfx_delay": 0.1
    },
    {
      "source_line": 48,
      "speaker": "priest",
      "text": "なぜ魔物がここに！",
      "cast": [],
      "cut": "S20_C31",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "priest": "exclaim"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.6,
      "accent_delay": 0.06,
      "sfx": "res://audio/adv/lab/decision22.wav",
      "sfx_delay": 0.1
    },
    {
      "source_line": 49,
      "speaker": "priest",
      "text": "今、鐘は鳴ったはずだ……！",
      "cast": [],
      "cut": "S20_C31",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "priest": "sweat"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 50,
      "speaker": "priest",
      "text": "なぜ、お前たちはまだここにいる……？",
      "cast": [],
      "cut": "S20_C31",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 51,
      "speaker": "priest",
      "text": "あり得ない……。",
      "cast": [],
      "cut": "S20_C31",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "priest": "sweat"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 52,
      "speaker": "priest",
      "text": "聖冠の御力を受けた鐘が鳴ったというのに……！",
      "cast": [],
      "cut": "S20_C31",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "priest": "exclaim"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 53,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "……せいかん？",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C32",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "hinata": "question"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 54,
      "speaker": "flare",
      "text": "王家に伝わるものです。この国を守るものだと、私は教わっていました。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C32",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 55,
      "speaker": "kraken",
      "text": "人も魔物も言いなりにするのが、国を守るってことなのかしら。",
      "cast": [
        "kraken"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C33",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 56,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "じゃあ、この鐘がおかしいのって……それと関係あるんすか？",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C34",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 57,
      "speaker": "flare",
      "text": "……分かりません。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C34",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 58,
      "speaker": "flare",
      "text": "でも、知らないままにはできません。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C34",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 59,
      "speaker": "priest",
      "text": "これ以上、聖冠について知る必要はない！",
      "cast": [],
      "cut": "S20_C35",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "priest": "exclaim"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.6,
      "accent_delay": 0.06,
      "sfx": "res://audio/adv/lab/decision22.wav",
      "sfx_delay": 0.1
    },
    {
      "source_line": 60,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "そう言われると、余計聞きたくなるっすね。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C36",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "hinata": "grumble"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 61,
      "speaker": "kraken",
      "text": "あの司祭さん、隠したいことがあるって自分で言ってるようなものねえ。",
      "cast": [
        "kraken"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C37",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 62,
      "speaker": "flare",
      "text": "……大司教なら知っているはずです。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C38",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 63,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "じゃあ、その人に聞きに行くっす。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C38",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 64,
      "speaker": "flare",
      "text": "ええ。",
      "cast": [
        "hinata",
        "flare"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C38",
      "music": "mystery"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 65,
      "speaker": "slime",
      "text": "また鐘が鳴ったら、どうするー？",
      "cast": [
        "slime",
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C39",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "slime": "question"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.5,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 66,
      "speaker": "hinata",
      "text": "そのときは、あたしが何回でも呼び戻すっす。",
      "cast": [
        "slime",
        "hinata"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C39",
      "music": "mystery",
      "accents": {
        "hinata": "joy_rays"
      },
      "accent_duration": 1.6,
      "accent_delay": 0.06
    },
    {
      "source_line": 67,
      "speaker": "kraken",
      "text": "頼もしいわねえ。でも、その前に鐘を止めたいところね。",
      "cast": [
        "kraken"
      ],
      "cut": "S20_C40",
      "music": "mystery"
